Dear Karen,

=20

Further to the final judgement this morning, I will be appealing the judgem=
ent and am in the process of arranging assistance.

=20

Please could you confirm that the judge in charge with Family Appeals is th=
e Honourable Sir Jonathan Cohen and confirm what the time limits for appeal =
are?

=20

I oppose anonymization of the judgement; please would you confirm what the =
time limit for submissions is.

=20

I also intend to make an application for a non-molestation order and until =
then I am asking that counsel be mindful in their work for the court that th=
ey should not under any circumstances include any matter that necessitates c=
ontact between the respondent and me, especially financial matters, as it is=
 extremely harmful to me and the history of mental abuse and coercive contro=
l is evidenced in my Part 25 statement and evidence submitted to the court.=20

=20

With kind wishes,

Nadia

=20

=20

Veritas Numquam Perit

UK: +44 79 1332 8615

US: +1 424 426 9226

